          %p
            Recalling from
            %a{:href => "#RelationToPotentiality"} above
            the quadruple of (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/comonad"}> co-
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad"} monadic
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modalities"} modalities
            associated with any
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/base+change"} base change
            one finds that its quantum analog for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+linear+types"} dependent linear types
            (along
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/family+of+finite+types"} finite fibers
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:FiniteBaseType"} (5)
          #eq:ModalitiesFromDependentLineaTypeFormers.maruku-equation
            %span.maruku-eq-number (6)
            %code.maruku-mathml
          %center
            %img{:src => "/nlab/files/TheFourModalitiesOfLinearBaseChange-221109.jpg", :width => "700"}/
          %p
            where the interpretation of the modal (
